This is my very unofficial, free-for-all patch for Nethack 3.1.0 - it
allows you to use the cursor keys on a Sun as a 'num_pad'. The num_pad
option has to be set for this to work.

I haven't tested this anywhere but on our Sparcs, it might not work on
your configuration. 

This should probably be in the next patch-level.

